Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 08:09:15 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] drm/tests: test the HDMI 3D structures listed from an EDID

Two sinks made by a script and read back with edid-decode: one declares
frame packing, field alternative, line alternative, L + depth and L +
depth + graphics + graphics-depth through 3D_Structure_ALL (HDMI 1.4a,
Table H-7), the other declares them per format through 3D_Structure_X
(Table H-2), with a picture plus depth structure on an interlaced format
and a reserved value. Each structure must be listed on the formats its
figure allows and only there, and nothing the sink did not declare.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5 via Claude Code
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/tests/Makefile           |   1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/tests/drm_edid_3d_test.c | 287 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 288 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/tests/drm_edid_3d_test.c

